   "stem": {
      "text": "The mass M of a mold colony, in grams, changes at a rate proportional to M, where t is measured in days. At \\( t = 0 \\), \\( M = 320 \\) grams, and at \\( t = 3 \\), \\( M = 128 \\) grams. Find an expression for \\( M(t) \\).",
