   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The model is \\( \\frac{dM}{dt} = kM \\). Separating and integrating gives \\( \\ln|M| = kt + C \\), so \\( M = M_0 e^{kt} \\), and the value at t = 0 gives \\( M_0 = 320 \\).",
         "rule_named": "separation of variables for proportional growth"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The second value gives \\( 128 = 320 e^{3k} \\), so \\( k = \\frac{\\ln{\\left(\\frac{2}{5} \\right)}}{3} \\).",
         "rule_named": "constant from a second data pair"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Therefore \\( M(t) = 320 e^{\\frac{t \\ln{\\left(\\frac{2}{5} \\right)}}{3}} \\) grams.",
